{"seq":19,"slug":"game-production-pipeline","title":"游戏制作管线与工具","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏制作管线与工具\">游戏制作管线与工具</h1><p>做一款游戏，难的往往不是某一行渲染代码或某一张原画，而是让几十甚至上百号人——策划、程序、美术、音频、测试、运营——围绕同一份不断变化的内容协同推进，并且在几年时间里始终保持「能出包、能玩、能改」。这正是「制作管线」要解决的问题：它是把创意变成可发布产品的那套流程、工具与约定的总和。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把游戏制作管线拆成四章，按从抽象到具体、再回到统筹的顺序层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」回答「整件事长什么样」。它先用一篇总览铺开从概念到上线后运营的完整生命周期，再讲清这条流水线上各个工种的角色与协作关系，最后聚焦最容易被低估、却决定项目生死的预制作与原型阶段。读完这一章，你脑中会有一张完整的地图，知道后面每个细节挂在地图的哪个位置。</p>\n<p>第二章「内容管线」深入流水线上最重的那段物料流动：美术资产如何从 DCC 软件流进引擎并保持一致、整个项目如何被持续地构建与验证、以及动辄上百 GB 的二进制资产该用什么版本控制扛住。这一章是「东西怎么从人手里变成游戏里的一帧」。</p>\n<p>第三章「工具与技术」讲团队如何为自己造梯子。商业引擎只给你一个起点，真正让团队跑得快的，是为本项目量身打造的自研工具与编辑器扩展、把内容从代码里解耦出来的数据驱动配置、以及把重复劳动交给机器的自动化脚本。这一章是「怎么让管线越用越顺」。</p>\n<p>第四章「项目管理」回到统筹层。它讲如何用里程碑切割漫长的开发、如何在欲望与工期之间守住范围，讲敏捷与各种生产方法在游戏这种高度不确定的创作里如何被裁剪使用，最后讲发布、上线运营与复盘——一个项目真正的收尾与下一个项目的起点。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是并列的知识点，而是一条因果链：你得先看懂全局（一），才知道内容如何流动（二）；内容流动的痛点催生了工具（三）；而工具与流程都要被管理在节奏与范围里才不至于失控（四）。建议初次阅读按章顺序走，回头查阅时再按需跳转——每篇文档都会在提到他篇主讲的概念时给出交叉链接。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"production-overview","title":"游戏制作流程总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/foundations/production-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-roles","title":"团队角色与协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/foundations/team-roles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"preproduction-prototyping","title":"预制作与原型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/foundations/preproduction-prototyping"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipelines","title":"内容管线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/pipelines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asset-pipeline","title":"美术资产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/pipelines/asset-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-pipeline","title":"构建与持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/pipelines/build-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"version-control-assets","title":"版本控制与大文件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/pipelines/version-control-assets"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tools-tech","title":"工具与技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/tools-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tooling-editor-extensions","title":"自研工具与编辑器扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/tools-tech/tooling-editor-extensions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-driven-config","title":"数据驱动与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/tools-tech/data-driven-config"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-scripting","title":"自动化与脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/tools-tech/automation-scripting"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"management","title":"项目管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"milestones-scope","title":"里程碑与范围管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/management/milestones-scope"},{"seq":2,"slug":"production-methodologies","title":"敏捷与生产方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/management/production-methodologies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shipping-postmortem","title":"发布、上线与复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-production-pipeline/management/shipping-postmortem"}]}]}